  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Minecraft</span></strong> музыка отличная, но что, если бы она была ещё веселее? С рипами от <em>SiIvagunner</em> так и есть!</p>\n<p>ТЕПЕРЬ С <strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">С<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">М<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Е<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Ш<span style=\"color:#3598db\">Н<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Ы<span style=\"color:#fff\">Е<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">К<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">А<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Р<span style=\"color:#3598db\">Т<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">И<span style=\"color:#fff\">Н<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">К<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">И<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">!<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">!<span style=\"color:#3598db\">!<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(Смотрите вкладку «Медиа»)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Вся музыка взята с канала на <strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube</span></strong> <em><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><strong><a style=\"color:#34495e\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@SiIvaGunner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SiIvagunner</a></strong></span></em></p>\n<p>Список изменённой музыки:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Beginning 2 (Меню)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Moog City 2 (Меню)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Echo in the Wind</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Haggstrom</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Infinite Amethyst</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Mice on Venus</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Minecraft</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Subwoofer Lullaby</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Sweden</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Wet hands</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#c2e0f4;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">Axolotl (Вода)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f8cac6;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">Taswell (Творческий режим)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f8cac6;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">Haunt Muskie (Творческий режим)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f8cac6;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">Aria Math (Творческий режим)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f8cac6;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">Dreiton (Творческий режим)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f8cac6;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">Blind Spots (Творческий режим)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">The End (Край (очевидно..))</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#b96ad9;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Boss (Бой с Эндер-драконом)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Alpha (Титры/Финальная поэма)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ba372a;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Dead Voxel (Незер)</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ba372a;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Concrete Halls (Незер)</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Список музыкальных дисков:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#34495e;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\">11</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">1<span style=\"color:#fff\">3</span></span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ba372a;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Blocks</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">C<span style=\"color:#169179\">a</span>t</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">C<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">h</span>ir<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">p</span></span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#bfedd2;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">F</span>a<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">r</span></span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Lava</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">Chicken</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#b96ad9;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">M<span style=\"color:#3598db\">al</span>l</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">M</span>e<span style=\"color:#fff\">ll</span>o<span style=\"color:#fff\">hi</span></span></strong></li>\n<li sty